            'qt6-wayland: for Wayland display support'
            'sdl3: for gamepad/controller and SDL audio support'
            'libzip: for loading ZIP archives (cheats, patches, zipped games)'
            'libwebp: for WebP image support'
            'libjpeg-turbo: for JPEG image support'
            'freetype2: for on-screen display font rendering'
            'spirv-cross: for runtime shader translation')
